    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d453">

                <pb facs="0389" n="377" xml:id="pg377"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.7962/77: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Liberia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wharton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-04-07T14:00:00-00:44">April 7, 1942—2
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 3:10 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>120. Roberts Field lease agreement and contract for Grumman service concluded and
                    signed today by Liberian Government and Panair. Lease for Fisherman Lake will
                    probably be signed April 9.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wharton</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
